      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْحَذٌ</span></b>  <i>A whetstone;</i> or <i>thing with which,</i> or
<i>upon which, one sharpens.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [hence,]
A <i>rough, severe,</i> or <i>violent,</i> driver: (O, K: [see
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَحَذَانٌ</span>:] and applied also as an epithet to a
driving. (O.)

